---
title: Evidence-based issue brief
description: Turn observations into a scoped issue without inventing a diagnosis.
schema:
  Observation:
    kind: "'observation'"
    detail: string
  Measurement:
    kind: "'measurement'"
    detail: string
    value: number
    unit: string
  Issue:
    title: string
    affectedWorkflow: string
    impact: string
    evidence: "(Observation | Measurement)[]"
    acceptance: string[]
    exclusions: string[]
input: Issue
---
# {title}

## Affected workflow

{affectedWorkflow}

## User impact

{impact}

## Evidence

<$each items={evidence} as="item">
  <$match value={item}>
    <$case type="Observation">
      - Observation: {item.detail}
    </$case>
    <$case type="Measurement">
      - {item.detail}: {item.value} {item.unit}
    </$case>
  </$match>
</$each>

<$show if={evidence.length === 0}>
  No supporting evidence was supplied. Capture a representative invocation before
  claiming a root cause or an improvement.
</$show>

## Acceptance criteria

<$each items={acceptance} as="criterion">
  - [ ] {criterion}
</$each>

<$show if={exclusions.length > 0}>
  ## Outside this issue

  <$each items={exclusions} as="exclusion">
    - {exclusion}
  </$each>
</$show>

Implementation choices remain open. Distinguish observations from inferred causes.
